{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06F880","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Chico把Peace Walker叫作Basilisco。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Basilisco？……啊，是西班牙语。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"真巧。我们最初也把Peace Walker的<R= 本体 ,PLATFORM>称作Basilisk。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 本体 ,PLATFORM>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"为什么取这个代号？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"一种叫Basilisk的蜥蜴能在各种地形上行走。紧急时甚至会直立起来，用两条腿从水面跑过去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"很适合这个要求适应中美洲所有地形的项目吧？而且还有传说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"传说？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"传说中的Basilisk身带剧毒。古罗马的书里还记载过这样的故事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"一名骑士用长枪刺死了Basilisk，结果毒液沿着长枪蔓延，连骑士和马都一起死了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不觉得这很像什么吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"……核威慑吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"答对了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"想杀死对方，自己也会死，所以谁都无法发动攻击。我本来想让Peace Walker成为这样的存在。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我不觉得人类有那么理性。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"哪怕明知自己会死……不，甚至正因为知道会死，人有时反而会做出无法理解的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"是吗。可那种行为本身，我就无法理解。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}